Licensing and source attribution

This repository is an educational assignment based on the supplied RAHBAR starter kit, with team-directed additions produced with the AI assistance disclosed in docs/AI-USAGE.md. No separate upstream open-source license was included in the supplied starter files inspected in this checkout. This file does not grant additional rights over that starter or third-party material; confirm applicable terms with the source owners before redistribution beyond the authorized coursework context.

FAST-NUCES PDFs/HTML remain owned by their respective source owners and are not committed here. corpus/MANIFEST.md records public URLs and exact checksums. Container images, Python packages and other tools retain their own licenses. No claim of ownership over those dependencies or source documents is made.

Jibran and Alishba are the named project team. Human review of licensing and final submission attribution remains pending. No repository-wide MIT/Apache license grant is asserted without that review.
